Ah-jin!

493
00:36:28.215 --> 00:36:29.216
Ah-jin.

494
00:36:29.925 --> 00:36:32.260
Kailangan kitang makausap.

495
00:36:33.845 --> 00:36:34.846
Tungkol saan ito?

496
